    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Traditional financial APIs were built exclusively for human developers, analysts, and customers who manually query and review endpoints. However, that fundamental assumption is rapidly shifting. According to recent reports, autonomous AI agents are now emerging as the fastest-growing class of API consumers. These artificial intelligence systems are increasingly handling the entire process by directly querying endpoints, processing complex responses, and executing decisions without human intervention.",
